{"product_id":"juul2-mango-pods-2-pods","title":"JUUL2 Mango Pods (2 Pods)","description":"\u003cp\u003eSavour the tropical delight of Mango pods by JUUL, packed with succulent notes of ripe mango. Each draw delivers a smooth, fruity richness that evokes exotic sunlit orchards in a perfectly balanced vape.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJUUL2 pods are only to be used with a JUUL2 Device. The JUUL2 Device is designed to only function with authentic JUUL2 pods manufactured by Juul Labs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's In The Box?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x JUUL2 pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatermelon flavour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 JUUL2 pod contains: ~1.2 mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine concentration: ~18 mg\/mL \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42010806059063,"sku":"JL2 Mango Pods","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/JUUL2-Pods-Mango-18mg_8379b26f-522e-4f90-93d5-9973e21b895f.jpg?v=1764775062","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul2-mango-pods-2-pods","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




